            "test setup: compiling test shim {src} with '{cc}' FAILED \
             (status {}). The compiler was found but rejected the shim \
             source; this is a compile failure, not an unsupported platform.\n\
             --- compiler stdout ---\n{}\n--- compiler stderr ---\n{}",
